reagent-name-genezine = genezine
reagent-desc-genezine = A genetic activator used by genetic chambers to awaken a selected dormant gene or restore a suppressed one.
reagent-name-genestatin = genestatin
reagent-desc-genestatin = Used by genetic chambers to suppress the expression of a selected acquired gene. Does not reduce genetic load.
reagent-name-genolysin = genolysin
reagent-desc-genolysin = Used by genetic chambers to remove a selected acquired gene and release its genetic load.
